<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <title>Reset Your Password - the-sept</title>
    <style>
      body {
        margin: 0;
        font-family: 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;
        background-color: #0d0d0d;
        color: #e0e0e0;
      }
      .container {
        max-width: 600px;
        margin: auto;
        padding: 2rem;
        background-color: #1a1a1a;
        color: #b2b0b0;
        border: 1px solid #333;
        border-radius: 8px;
      }
      .logo {
        font-size: 3rem;
        font-weight: bold;
        color: #ffffff;
        letter-spacing: 2px;
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
        text-align: center;
      }
      .message {
        font-size: 1rem;
        line-height: 1.6;
        margin-bottom: 2rem;
        text-align: center;
      }
      .reset-button {
        display: block;
        width: fit-content;
        margin: 0 auto;
        background-color: #ffffff;
        color: #0d0d0d;
        padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;
        border-radius: 5px;
        text-decoration: none;
        font-weight: bold;
        transition: background-color 0.3s ease;
      }
      .reset-button:hover {
        background-color: #e0e0e0;
      }
      .fallback-link {
        margin-top: 1rem;
        font-size: 0.85rem;
        text-align: center;
        word-break: break-word;
      }
      .footer {
        margin-top: 2rem;
        font-size: 0.85rem;
        color: #777;
        text-align: center;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="logo">the-sept</div>
      <div class="message">
        Forgot your password? Don't worry — it happens to the best of us.<br />
        Click the button below to reset your password and regain access.
      </div>

      <a href="{{link}}" class="reset-button">Reset Password</a>

      <div class="fallback-link">
        Or copy and paste this URL into your browser:<br />
        {{link}}
      </div>

      <div class="footer">
        If you didn't request a password reset, you can safely ignore this email.<br />
        This link will expire in 1 hour for your security.
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>